    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nocturne FX\u2122</strong> starts simple\u2014dodge pipes, fly with precision\u2014but the skies won\u2019t stay calm for long. Chaos builds with each moment: sudden storms, unpredictable power-ups, shifting rules, and unseen forces that punish complacency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced, score-chasing arcade game where your actions shape the challenge. Easy to learn, brutally adaptive, and constantly evolving\u2014<strong>Nocturne FX\u2122</strong> isn\u2019t here to be fair. It\u2019s here to test your limits.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nocturne FX\u2122</strong> starts simple\u2014dodge pipes, fly with precision\u2014but the skies won\u2019t stay calm for long. Chaos builds with each moment: sudden storms, unpredictable power-ups, shifting rules, and unseen forces that punish complacency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced, score-chasing arcade game where your actions shape the challenge. Easy to learn, brutally adaptive, and constantly evolving\u2014<strong>Nocturne FX\u2122</strong> isn\u2019t here to be fair. It\u2019s here to test your limits.</p>",
